{"unit_id":"codebam__dsh-opensandbox#card-zh","repo":"codebam/dsh-opensandbox","commit":"5f9deed6d59a5c35d42e0102cbd65ee78d349d68","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@codebam/dsh-opensandbox 为 DSH 提供 OpenSandbox 执行环境：profile bundle 替换 ctx.subprocess、ctx.sandbox 和 ctx.fs，让命令与 PTY 会话在容器中运行，并让文件工具共用工作区挂载策略。它按会话创建容器、转发命令输出、提供 WebSocket 终端、挂载感知的文件访问及临时目录命令。适合通过 OpenSandbox 执行 DSH 项目命令的用户。需 Node.js 20+ 和可访问的 lifecycle/execd 服务；API key 可从配置、环境变量或文件读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:132-158","src/subprocess.mjs:273-313","src/subprocess.mjs:415-455","src/subprocess.mjs:681-716","src/fs.mjs:34-79","src/commands.mjs:83-137","src/client.mjs:14-42","package.json:42-44","README.md:41-53"]}
